---
import { ArrowLeft, Clipboard, Eraser, RotateCcw, Sparkles } from 'lucide-astro';
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="更多工具 · 白子诩" description="一组在浏览器本地运行的轻量在线工具。">
  <main class="tools-page section-wrap">
    <a class="back-link" href="/"><ArrowLeft /> 返回首页</a>
    <header class="tools-page-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">MORE TOOLS / LOCAL FIRST</p><h1>更多工具</h1><p>解决那些不值得安装软件、却总要花几分钟的小问题。输入只留在你的浏览器里。</p></div><div class="tools-page-mark"><Sparkles /></div></header>
    <section class="tool-workbench">
      <aside class="tool-nav" aria-label="工具选择"><p class="eyebrow">MORE TOOLS</p><button class="tool-tab active" data-tool="timestamp" type="button">时间戳转换 <small>timestamp</small></button><button class="tool-tab" data-tool="base64" type="button">Base64 编解码 <small>base64</small></button><button class="tool-tab" data-tool="hash" type="button">MD5 摘要 <small>md5</small></button><button class="tool-tab" data-tool="color" type="button">颜色值转换 <small>color</small></button><button class="tool-tab" data-tool="random-color" type="button">随机颜色 <small>random color</small></button><button class="tool-tab" data-tool="json" type="button">JSON 格式化 <small>json</small></button><button class="tool-tab" data-tool="qr" type="button">二维码生成 <small>QR code</small></button></aside>
      <div class="tool-panel">
        <div class="tool-panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow" id="tool-kicker">TIME UTILITY</span><h2 id="tool-title">时间戳转换</h2></div><button class="tool-clear" id="tool-clear" type="button"><Eraser /> 清空</button></div>
        <div class="tool-fields"><label><span id="tool-input-label">输入时间戳（毫秒）</span><textarea id="tool-input" rows="5" placeholder="例如：1713600000000"></textarea></label><label><span id="tool-output-label">转换结果</span><textarea id="tool-output" rows="5" readonly></textarea><div class="qr-output" id="qr-output" hidden></div><div class="color-swatch" id="color-swatch" hidden></div></label></div>
        <div class="tool-panel-actions"><button class="benchmark-primary" id="tool-run" type="button">转换 <Sparkles /></button><button class="benchmark-secondary" id="tool-copy" type="button"><Clipboard /> 复制结果</button><button class="benchmark-secondary" id="qr-download" type="button" hidden>下载二维码</button></div><p class="tool-note" id="tool-note">支持毫秒时间戳，也会显示当前时间。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="tools-page-foot"><RotateCcw /><p>这些工具不请求服务器、不写入数据库。关闭页面后，输入内容也不会被保留。</p></section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<script src="../../../scripts/tiny-tools.ts"></script>
